cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or its aggregate results, please cite it as below,
  together with the accompanying article.
type: software
title: HETUS household electricity profiling pipeline
abstract: >-
  Python pipeline that derives household electricity demand profiles at
  10-minute resolution from the 2010 wave of the Harmonised European Time Use
  Surveys (HETUS) for 15 countries, clusters them globally, by day type, by
  country and by country and day type, and validates the clusters
  statistically. The outputs folder holds the aggregate results behind the
  accompanying article, under Eurostat's publication rules for HETUS. The
  HETUS microdata are Eurostat scientific use files and are not included.
